# Feature Value Filter

Every feature must help users do at least one of:

1. Make better decisions.
2. Execute faster.
3. Learn faster.
4. Build reusable assets.
5. Compound results over time.

If it does none of these, challenge the implementation before writing code. Explain the gap against `PROJECT.md` and ask whether to proceed or reshape the request.
